    rdfs:label "Air Bud"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Air Bud is a 1997 sports comedy film directed by Charles Martin Smith. The film was financially successful, grossing $4 million in its opening weekend and totaling $27.8 million in its run against an estimated $3 million budget."@en ;
