dbr:B._Monkey a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "B. Monkey"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "B. Monkey is a British-American 1998 crime drama film directed by Michael Radford. Originally, Michael Caton-Jones was attached to direct the adaptation of the homonymous 1992 book by Andrew Davies, but left over creative differences. Asia Argento was allegedly sexually assaulted by Harvey Weinstein during the production of this film."@en ;
