dbr:Bikini_Beach a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Bikini Beach"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Bikini Beach is a 1964 American teen film directed by William Asher and starring Frankie Avalon and Annette Funicello. The film belongs to the beach party genre of movies, popular in the 1960s. This is the third in the series of seven films produced by American International Pictures (AIP)."@en ;
