    dbo:abstract "But I'm a Cheerleader is a 1999 American satirical, black comedy romantic teen film directed by Jamie Babbit, written by Babbit and Brian Wayne Peterson. Natasha Lyonne stars as Megan Bloomfield, a high school cheerleader whose parents send her to a residential in-patient conversion therapy camp to \"cure\" her lesbianism."@en ;
