dbr:Carnosaur_3%3A_Primal_Species a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Carnosaur 3: Primal Species"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Carnosaur 3: Primal Species is a 1996 direct-to-video science fiction horror film. It is the sequel to the 1995 film Carnosaur 2, and is currently the final installation of the Carnosaur series. It stars Scott Valentine, Janet Gunn, Rick Dean, Rodger Halston and Anthony Peck. The film follows a military team as they try to capture several genetically reconstructed dinosaurs. It received negative reviews."@en ;
