dbr:Crazy_in_Alabama a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Crazy in Alabama"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Crazy in Alabama is a 1999 American comedy-drama film directed by Antonio Banderas and based on Mark Childress' 1993 novel of the same name. The film stars Melanie Griffith as an abused housewife who becomes an actress, while her nephew deals with a racially motivated murder involving a corrupt sheriff. It marked Dakota Johnson's film debut."@en ;
