    rdfs:label "Cutter's Way"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Cutter's Way (also known as Cutter and Bone) is a 1981 American neo noir thriller directed by Ivan Passer. The film stars Jeff Bridges, John Heard, and Lisa Eichhorn. The screenplay was adapted from the 1976 novel Cutter and Bone by Newton Thornburg."@en ;
