dbr:Date_with_an_Angel a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Date with an Angel"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Date with an Angel is a 1987 American romantic fantasy comedy film starring Emmanuelle Béart, Phoebe Cates and Michael E. Knight. The film was written and directed by Tom McLoughlin. The original music score was composed by Randy Kerber. The visual effects were produced at Boss Film Studios under the supervision of Visual Effects Supervisor Richard Edlund. The film was marketed with the tagline \"Jim is about to marry a princess... but he's in love with an angel.\""@en ;
