dbr:Gang_Related a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Gang Related"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Gang Related, alternatively known as Criminal Intent, is a 1997 American action crime thriller film written and directed by Jim Kouf starring James Belushi, Tupac Shakur, Dennis Quaid, Lela Rochon, David Paymer and James Earl Jones. The film revolves around two corrupt cops (Belushi and Shakur) who attempt to frame a homeless man (Quaid) for the murder of an undercover DEA agent that they themselves had actually killed. The film was shot over a period of a month in August 1996 and wrapped filming just two weeks before Tupac Shakur’s death on September 13, 1996. It marked his final film appearance and was released a year after his death."@en ;
    dbo:country "United States" ;
    dbo:director "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jim_Kouf" ;
