dbr:Herbie_Goes_to_Monte_Carlo a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Herbie Goes to Monte Carlo"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Herbie Goes to Monte Carlo is a 1977 American comedy adventure film and the third installment of The Love Bug film series made by Walt Disney Productions starring Herbie—the white 1963 Volkswagen racing Beetle with a mind of its own. In the film, Dean Jones returns as champion race car driver Jim Douglas (reprising his role from the first film in the series), joined this time by his somewhat cynical and eccentric riding mechanic Wheely Applegate (Don Knotts). The film follows Douglas, Applegate, and Herbie as they participate in the fictional Trans-France Race, a road race from Paris, France, to Monte Carlo, Monaco."@en ;
