dbr:Lethal_Weapon_4 a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Lethal Weapon 4"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Lethal Weapon 4 is a 1998 American buddy cop action film directed and produced by Richard Donner, and starring Mel Gibson, Danny Glover, Joe Pesci, Rene Russo, Chris Rock, and Jet Li (in his international film debut). It is the fourth installment in the Lethal Weapon film series. It is the last film in the series directed by Donner before his death, and the last to be released theatrically. A sequel titled Lethal Finale is in development for the streaming service HBO Max. Glover and Gibson will reprise their roles as Riggs and Murtaugh, with Gibson also in talks to direct."@en ;
    dbo:country "United States" ;
    dbo:director "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Richard_Donner" ;
