dbr:Meet_Joe_Black a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Meet Joe Black"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Meet Joe Black is a 1998 American romantic fantasy film directed and produced by Martin Brest, and starring Brad Pitt, Anthony Hopkins, and Claire Forlani. The screenplay was written by Bo Goldman, Kevin Wade, Ron Osborn, and Jeff Reno, and is loosely based on the 1934 film Death Takes a Holiday, an adaptation of the 1924 Italian play La morte in vacanza by Alberto Casella. It was the second pairing of Hopkins and Pitt after their 1994 film Legends of the Fall."@en ;
