dbr:Mortal_Thoughts a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Mortal Thoughts"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Mortal Thoughts is a 1991 American neo-noir mystery thriller film directed by Alan Rudolph and starring Demi Moore, Glenne Headly, Bruce Willis, John Pankow and Harvey Keitel. Told in narrative flashbacks set in a police interrogation, the film centers on a woman implicated in the violent murder of her friend's abusive, drug-addicted husband. Its title is derived from a quote in William Shakespeare's The Tragedy of Macbeth."@en ;
