    dbp:views 2 .

dbr:One_False_Move a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "One False Move"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "One False Move is a 1992 American crime thriller film directed by Carl Franklin and co-written by Billy Bob Thornton. The film stars Thornton alongside Bill Paxton and Cynda Williams. The low-budget production was about to be released straight to home video when it was finished, but became popular through word of mouth, convincing the distributor to give the film a theatrical release. Film critic Gene Siskel voted this film as his favorite of 1992."@en ;
