    rdfs:label "Police Academy 3: Back in Training"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Police Academy 3: Back in Training is a 1986 American comedy film directed by Jerry Paris. It is the third installment of the Police Academy franchise and the sequel to Police Academy 2: Their First Assignment. Despite receiving generally negative reviews, it was an overall box office success, earning $107 million against a budget of $12 million."@en ;
