dbr:Psycho_Beach_Party a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Psycho Beach Party"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Psycho Beach Party is a 2000 comedy horror film based on the off-Broadway play of the same name, directed by Robert Lee King. Charles Busch wrote both the original play and the screenplay. As the title suggests, Psycho Beach Party, set in 1962 Malibu Beach, is a parody of 1950s psychodramas, 1960s beach movies and 1980s slasher films."@en ;
