dbr:Radio_Days a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Radio Days"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Radio Days is a 1987 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Woody Allen, who also narrates the story. The film looks back on an American family's life during the Golden Age of Radio using both music and memories to tell the story. It stars an ensemble cast."@en ;
