    dbo:abstract "Raining Stones is a 1993 film directed by Ken Loach and starring Bruce Jones, , Ricky Tomlinson, Tom Hickey and . It tells the story of a man who cannot afford to buy his daughter a First Communion dress, and makes disastrous choices in trying to raise the money. The film won the Jury Prize at the 1993 Cannes Film Festival."@en ;
