dbr:Saturn_3 a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Saturn 3"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Saturn 3 is a 1980 British science fiction film produced and directed by Stanley Donen, and starring Farrah Fawcett, Kirk Douglas and Harvey Keitel. The screenplay was written by Martin Amis, from a story by John Barry. Though a British production (made by Lew Grade's ITC Entertainment and shot at Shepperton Studios), the film has an American cast and director. Harvey Keitel's biographer called the film the \"nadir of his career\"."@en ;
