dbr:Sinbad_and_the_Eye_of_the_Tiger a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger is a 1977 fantasy film directed by Sam Wanamaker and featuring stop-motion effects by Ray Harryhausen. The film stars Patrick Wayne, Taryn Power, Jane Seymour and Patrick Troughton. The third and final Sinbad film released by Columbia Pictures, it follows The 7th Voyage of Sinbad (1958) and The Golden Voyage of Sinbad (1973)."@en ;
